  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in warmth and stunning wildlife artistry with this custom wolf bedding set from Jeminise. Featuring a unique native-inspired wolf design, this versatile quilt brings both comfort and rustic charm to your bedroom decor, making it a perfect cozy addition for relaxing on the sofa, lounging in bed, or taking along on outdoor family adventures.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize this quilt with your own custom name or text to create a truly unique bedding piece or a thoughtful gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Factual Product Form:</strong> A beautifully crafted native-print quilt set, perfect for adding a country western style to any bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfortable Material:</strong> Made from a soft, lightweight, and breathable polyester-cotton blend designed to keep you warm in the winter and cool in the summer.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Ideal for indoor use on your bed or couch, as well as outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable in cold water; dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully without heat.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Accessories:</strong> Bedding set options include the main quilt with the choice to add matching pillow covers to complete the look.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Wolf Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Wolf Themed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>2 pillow covers (optional), Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
